      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand your concerns, but attempting to manage the issue yourself is not recommended. Ignoring your symptoms or trying to \"flush out\" an infection can lead to more serious complications, such as worsening UTI symptoms, Kidney damage, or delayed diagnosis of a more severe condition. This approach may also allow the bacteria to multiply, making it harder to treat effectively. I encourage you to consider visiting a doctor even if it feels minor, as they can still provide guidance, diagnosis, and early treatment to prevent long-term consequences.",
